# Element Reactions

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `02_DOMAIN_RULES.todo`, `04_TERRITORY_PAINTING.todo`

## Purpose

Make Ice, Fire, and Mist mechanically deterministic and immediately readable.

## Tasks

- [ ] Create Ice and Fire element configuration.
- [ ] Create Mist reaction configuration.
- [ ] Implement reaction ownership/state rules.
- [ ] Implement contested-reaction bank award.
- [ ] Implement reaction event.
- [ ] Implement visual material state.
- [ ] Implement reaction VFX placeholder.
- [ ] Implement reaction audio placeholder.
- [ ] Define first player status interaction.
- [ ] Implement status telegraph and duration.
- [ ] Add conversion and status tests.
- [ ] Run comprehension playtest.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Players can distinguish Ice, Fire, and Mist without relying on color alone.
- [ ] Reaction result is deterministic.
- [ ] Visible reaction occurs at the authoritative contact.
- [ ] Status effects are telegraphed and configurable.
- [ ] Playtesters predict the reaction after seeing it twice.

